+        """Estimate the shared viscosity by weighted least squares.
+
+        Each calibration measurement is an independent Gaussian observation,
+        so its known standard deviation supplies the natural residual weight.
+        The only unknown model parameter is viscosity; all experiment settings
+        are supplied exactly in each record.
+        """
+        records = list(records)
+        if not records:
